    },
    "Premium accounts download directly. Free accounts download through the Nexus website: Tadpole opens the file's page, you click **Slow download**, and Tadpole catches the download and installs it. With several mods, the next page opens by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
